  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n20.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="15"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/37" n="37"/>Thus spoke the Lord to Moses: <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/38" n="38"/>Speak to the children of Israel and tell them to make themselves show-fringes upon the corners of their garments throughout their generations and to fasten to the fringe of each corner a thread of skyblue wool. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/39" n="39"/>They shall be show-fringes to you so that when you look upon them, you will remember all the <tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n22.jpg" n="14"/>commandments of the Lord and fulfil them. And do not follow your heart and your eyes after which you go astray. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/40" n="40"/>Thus may you remember and fulfil all my commandments and be holy unto your God. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/41" n="41"/>I am the Lord your God who led you out of the land of Egypt in order to be your God. I am the Lord your God. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
